INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(2981,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 15:19:48.566550','Portraying qualities of disabilities in deficit language disparages people for their natural brain processing traits. Perceived clumsiness can be due to medical condition, lack of accessibility, or sheer coincidence.\ToClarify:
INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(2982,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 15:19:52.811041','Disability is preferred because of its more inclusive nature normalizing individual experiences with various conditions and focusing on the need for accessibility as the root of disability.\ToClarify:
