INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(3013,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 15:21:02.124870','Learning disabilities are often thought to be inherent traits linked to a person''s identity and personality. Disabilities are not meant to be overcome, the lack of accessibility is what is meant to be overcome. Portraying qualities, attitudes, behaviors, emotional states/responses of those with disabilities using deficit language disparages people for their natural brain processing traits.\ToClarify:
