INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(3022,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 15:21:26.243714','Adaptive education is a newer term for remedial classes and classes designed with accessibility support in mind. It is a term the disability community is trying to normalize and institute more in schools. "Special Ed" has been used to identify people, however, it is disparaging and unnecessary. Using "special ed" as identity-first to label a student is inappropriate.\ToClarify:
