INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(3029,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 15:21:43.037265','Symptoms is directly related to the medical field. The social model of disability seeks to gear away from the medical model. Many people, particularly neurodivergent people own the traits and qualities of their conditions and disabilities as being part of who they are as people, as opposed to what their diagnosis is. Many Disabled people think of their "symptoms" as traits of their identity.\ToClarify:
