INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(3487,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 15:42:51.315406','Disorder is considered a medical term often relating to definitions of chaos, disturbances, or irregularity. "Disorder" is also often used to refer to functioning labels that gatekeep accessibility support. "Disability" is preferred because of its more inclusive nature normalizing individual experiences with various conditions and focusing on the need for accessibility as the root of disability. The community is split and uses both person-first and identity-first language.\ToClarify:
