INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(4109,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 16:02:38.477059','Disability is preferred because of its more inclusive nature normalizing individual experiences with various conditions and focusing on the need for accessibility as the root of disability. Auditory disabilities can be caused, due, and categorized by various conditions. It is best to be specific with the disability when possible. Portraying qualities of disabilities in deficit language disparages people for their natural brain processing traits. There are various kinds of Audio-related disabilities that can be identified and labeled in different ways depending on the qualities of the disability. It''s best to identify the disability as accurately as you possibly can.\ToClarify:
