INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(4736,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 16:17:28.696035','Disorder is considered a medical term often relating to definitions of chaos, disturbances, or irregularity. "Disorder" is also often used to refer to functioning labels that gatekeep accessibility support. "Disability" is preferred because of its more inclusive nature normalizing individual experiences with various conditions and focusing on the need for accessibility as the root of disability. There are various kinds of Communication disabilities that can be identified and labeled in different ways depending on the qualities of the disability. It''s best to identify the disability as accurately as you possibly can.\ToClarify:
INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(4737,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 16:17:30.538318','Disorder is considered a medical term often relating to definitions of chaos, disturbances, or irregularity. "Disorder" is also often used to refer to functioning labels that gatekeep accessibility support. "Disability" is preferred because of its more inclusive nature normalizing individual experiences with various conditions and focusing on the need for accessibility as the root of disability. There are various kinds of Language and Speech disabilities that can be identified and labeled in different ways depending on the qualities of the disability. It''s best to identify the disability as accurately as you possibly can.\ToClarify:
INSERT INTO "rules_rule" VALUES(4738,'2023-11-15','2023-11-15 16:17:33.036629','Portraying qualities, attitudes, behaviors, emotional states/responses of those with disabilities using deficit language disparages people for their natural brain processing traits. Portraying specific speech patterns as "oddities" makes it seem as though Disabled people speak differently to non-Disabled people, when all people speak differently regardless of disability.\ToClarify:
